m worried\nthey might be onto the fact\n\n1053\n00:57:39,790 --> 00:57:42,042\nthat I pointed Shuri and Okoye\nin the right direction.\n\n1054\n00:57:42,209 --> 00:57:43,919\nLook, if they're in danger,\nI wanna help.\n\n1055\n00:57:44,002 --> 00:57:45,921\nBut I can't if I don't know\nwhat's going on.\n\n1056\n00:57:46,088 --> 00:57:48,799\nI am afraid there is\na new world power at play.\n\n1057\n00:57:49,216 --> 00:57:51,176\nA country\nthat's already on our radar?\n\n1058\n00:57:51,259 --> 00:57:52,260\nOr you mean someone else?\n\n1059\n00:57:52,344 --> 00:57:54,346\nRAMONDA: That is all I can say for now.\n\n1060\n00:57:54,513 --> 00:57:55,514\nPlease,\n\n1061\n00:57:55,931 --> 00:57:58,600\nalert me if your government\ndecides to act\n\n1062\n00:57:58,684 --> 00:58:00,268\non their suspicions.\n\n1063\n00:58:00,352 --> 00:58:01,520\nYeah. Sure.\n\n1064\n00:58:02,104 --> 00:58:06,108\nUh, look, if there's anything\nI can do to help, let me know.\n\n1065\n00:58:06,274 --> 00:58:08,068\nI owe Shuri my life.\n\n1066\n00:58:08,819 --> 00:58:12,739\nGRIOT, did Shuri have\nher earrings with her?\n\n1067\n00:58:12,906 --> 00:58:15,450\nGRIOT: / lost track of them\nin the North Atlantic,\n\n1068\n00:58:15,617 --> 00:58:18,787\nbut the people who took her\nspoke Yucatec Mayan.\n\n1069\n00:58:28,922 --> 00:58:29,923\n(RAMONDA SPEAKING\nHAITIAN CREOLE)\n\n1070\n00:59:07,044 --> 00:59:08,920\n-Hmm?\n-GIRL 1: Oui, Miss Nakia.\n\n1071\n00:59:11,506 --> 00:59:12,507\n(GIRL 1 SPEAKING)\n\n1072\n00:59:12,591 --> 00:59:13,592\n(GIRL 2 SPEAKING)\n\n1073\n00:59:19,389 --> 00:59:20,640\n(IN ENGLISH) Queen Mother.\n\n1074\n00:59:22,476 --> 00:59:24,770\nEverything is a lesson here\nfor the children.\n\n1075\n00:59:24,936 --> 00:59:27,939\nThey painted the walls,\nthey feed the fish,\n\n1076\n00:59:28,106 --> 00:59:30,400\nand they grow\neverything we eat here.\n\n1077\n00:59:30,567 --> 00:59:33,195\nI recognize\nsome of the concepts here.\n\n1078\n00:59:33,361 --> 00:59:35,322\nBut