{"timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:28:00.816Z","ordinal":46,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_WsDvdwQtLhSuL0YEN8qVHbZ2","output":"Chunk ID: b83173\nWall time: 0.0000 seconds\nProcess exited with code 0\nOriginal token count: 1281\nOutput:\n1080\n00:59:40,827 --> 00:59:44,164\nYou were missed\nat T'Challa's funeral.\n\n1081\n00:59:47,292 --> 00:59:48,293\nOh...\n\n1082\n00:59:55,926 --> 00:59:57,135\n(QUIETLY) Queen Mother.\n\n1083\n00:59:57,302 --> 01:00:00,263\nRAMONDA.: It's been six years\nsince you left us.\n\n1084\n01:00:00,430 --> 01:00:03,600\nI thought you would at least\ncome back for the ceremony.\n\n1085\n01:00:06,353 --> 01:00:07,854\nI was afraid\n\n1086\n01:00:08,730 --> 01:00:12,526\nof how final\nthe funeral would be.\n\n1087\n01:00:12,609 --> 01:00:15,654\nNakia, daughter of Yaa,\n\n1088\n01:00:16,947 --> 01:00:20,826\nwherever you go,\nyou are still Wakandan,\n\n1089\n01:00:20,992 --> 01:00:24,621\nand you know\ndeath is not the end.\n\n1090\n01:00:29,709 --> 01:00:31,002\n(IN XHOSA)\n\n1091\n01:00:35,757 --> 01:00:37,509\n(IN ENGLISH)\nHow is everyone at home?\n\n1092\n01:00:37,676 --> 01:00:40,011\nShuri has been taken.\n\n1093\n01:00:40,720 --> 01:00:41,721\nWhat?\n\n1094\n01:00:42,139 --> 01:00:45,142\nYou have infiltrated\nmany nations before.\n\n1095\n01:00:45,559 --> 01:00:46,852\n(IN XHOSA)\n\n1096\n01:00:47,561 --> 01:00:48,895\n(IN ENGLISH)\nI was a different person then.\n\n1097\n01:00:48,979 --> 01:00:52,023\nI need someone who can find\nwhere she is being held,\n\n1098\n01:00:52,190 --> 01:00:55,235\nand rescue her,\nwithout being seen.\n\n1099\n01:00:55,610 --> 01:00:58,446\nWho on earth would risk war\nwith Wakanda?\n\n1100\n01:01:00,824 --> 01:01:01,908\nRIRI: Oh, my God. (GASPING)\n\n1101\n01:01:01,992 --> 01:01:03,285\nSHURI: Okay, breathe. Breathe.\n\n1102\n01:01:03,368 --> 01:01:04,828\nOh, don't tell me to breathe.\n\n1103\n01:01:04,995 --> 01:01:05,996\nWhere the hell are we?\n\n1104\n01:01:06,163 --> 01:01:08,290\nWe're in a cave.\nI'm not sure where.\n\n1105\n01:01:08,373 --> 01:01:09,374\nOh, my God!\n\n1106\n01:01:09,916 --> 01:01:11,501\n(GASPS) What is that?\n\n1107\n01:01:11,668 --> 01:01:14,421\nSHURI: Glow worms.\nTheir larva gives off light.\n\n1108\n01:01:14,504 --> 01:01:16,423\n-(RIRI GASPS HEAVILY)\n-SHURI: Just calm down.\n\n1109\n01:01:16,840 --> 01:01:18,717\nOkay, is there, like,\na new Black Panther\n\n1110\n01:01:18,800 --> 01:01:20,051\nthat you can call\nto come and get us?\n\n1111\n01:01:20,135 --> 01:01:21,136\nNo.\n\n1112\n01:01:21,219 --> 01:01:22,220\nWhy not?\n\n1113\n01:01:22,304 --> 01:01:24,097\nBecause it doesn't\nwork like that anymore.\n\n1114\n01:01:24,848 --> 01:01:26,433\nThe Black Panther is gone.\n\n1115\n01:01:27,100 --> 01:01:28,185\nSo y'all stopped\nhaving Black Panthers\n\n1116\n01:01:28,268 --> 01:01:29,269\nwhen I get kidnapped?\n\n1117\n01:01:29,769 --> 01:01:31,771\n(MYSTERIOUS MUSIC PLAYS)\n\n1118\n01:01:34,774 --> 01:01:35,775\n(IN MAYAN)\n\n1119\n01:01:42,365 --> 01:01:44,534\n(IN ENGLISH)\nDo you understand her?\n\n1120\n01:01:44,701 --> 01:01:46,203\nNot completely.\n\n1121\n01:01:48,288 --> 01:01:49,497\nNuh-uh.\n\n1122\n01:01:49,664 --> 01:01:52,000\nThat is some supervillain shit\nright there.\n\n1123\n01:01:52,167 --> 01:01:53,501\nThat's in every movie.\n\n1124\n01:01:53,668 --> 01:01:54,920\nPrincess Leia.\n\n1125\n01:01:55,086 --> 01:01:56,338\nBelle from\nBeauty and the Beast.\n\n1126\n01:01:56,421 --> 01:01:59,049\nThat white chick\nfrom Indiana Jones.\n\n1127\n01:01:59,132 --> 01:02:00,258\nIt's fine.\n\n1128\n01:02:00,342 --> 01:02:02,886\nYou should see what I have\nto wear at Warrior Falls.\n\n1129\n01:02:03,803 --> 01:02:05,972\n(MYSTERIOUS MUSIC CONTINUES)\n\n1130\n01:02:09,309 --> 01:02:10,310\n(IN MAYAN)\n\n1131\n01:02:11,311 --> 01:02:12,729\n(IN ENGLISH, HESITATES) Wait.\n\n1132\n01:02:12,812 --> 01:02:15,273\nYou're not leaving me in here,\nare you?\n\n1133\n01:02:15,357 --> 01:02:16,816\nI'm coming back.\n\n1134\n01:02:17,484 --> 01:02:18,693\nI'm coming back.\n\n1135\n01:02:18,860 --> 01:02:20,779\nStay calm.\n\n1136\n01:02:28,161 --> 01:02:29,162\n(IN MAYAN)\n\n1137\n01:02:30,914 --> 01:02:31,998\n(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)\n\n1138\n01:02:33,416 --> 01:02:35,168\n(CRYPTIC MUSIC PLAYING)\n\n1139\n01:02:38,171 --> 01:02:39,965\n(INDISTINCT CHATTER)\n\n1140\n01:02:40,757 --> 01:02:42,175\n(GOATS BLEATING)\n\n1141\n01:02:43,343 --> 01:02:45,053\n(IN SPANISH)\n\n1142\n01:03:14,833 --> 01:03:15,875\n(IN MAYAN)\n\n1143\n01:03:17,585 --> 01:03:19,838\n(CRYPTIC MUSIC CONTINUES)\n\n1144\n01:03:28,513 --> 01:03:30,015\n(IN SPANISH)\n\n1145\n01:04:10,847 --> 01:04:12,807\n(EERIE MUSIC PLAYING)\n\n1146\n01:04:29,824 --> 01:04:31,451\n(IN ENGLISH) Princess.\n\n1147\n01:04:31,618 --> 01:04:32,619\nWelcome.\n\n1148\n01:04:34,579 --> 01:04:37,040\nPlease, feel free.\n\n1149\n01:04:44,297 --> 01:04:45,590\nThis is beautiful.\n\n1150\n01:04:46,424 --> 01:04:48,176\nThat was my mother's.\n\n1151\n01:04:58,228 --> 01:05:00,772\nThese are all\nMesoamerican artifacts.\n\n1152\n01:05:02,232 --> 01:05:04,109\nMost likely 16th century.\n\n1153\n01:05:05,318 --> 01:05:07,529\nHave you been alive\nsince then?\n\n1154\n01:05:09,489 --> 01:05:11,032\nYour mother was human.\n\n1155\n01:05:12,492 --> 01:05:13,493\nShe was.\n\n1156\n01:05:13,660 --> 01:05:15,870\nThen she became\nsomething else.\n\n1157\n01:05:16,037 --> 01:05:18,081\n-How?\n-\"How?\"\n\n1158\n01:05:18,665 --> 01:05:21,126\n\"How\" is never\nas important as \"why.\"\n\n1159\n01:05:30,301 --> 01:05:32,303\n(EERIE MUSIC CONTINUES)\n\n1160\n01:05:32,387 --> 01:05:33,847\nNAMOR: My mother\nand her village\n\n1161\n01:05:33,930 --> 01:05:35,515\nwere driven from their farms\n\n1162\n"}}
